DESCRIPTION:Vayakhel (“He Assembled”) opens as God commands the Israel
 ites to observe the Sabbath. Moses asks for material donations for the bui
 lding of the Mishkan (Tabernacle)\, and the people donate. A group of arti
 sans designated by God begin building the Mishkan and its vessels.\n\nTora
 h: Exodus 35:1-38:20\, 30:11-16\nHaftarah: II Kings 12:1-17 | Shabbat Shek
 alim\nHaftarah for Sephardim: II Kings 11:17-12:17\n\nhttps://hebcal.com/s
 /5787/22?uc=ical-london-march-2027
